ENTRY            30114   20080208   20080530   20080530       3126
SUBENT        30114001   20080208   20080530   20080530       3126
BIB                 14         28
INSTITUTE  (3SAFPEL)experiment performed at
           (3SAFSUN)experiment performed at
           (3SAFSCT)for l.M.Spitz and  F.D.Barnard
REFERENCE  (J,NP/A,121,655,196812) Full description, graphs
           (W,BROOKS,196909) Minor corrections.
AUTHOR     (L.M.Spitz, E.Barnard, F.D.Brooks)
TITLE      Neutron capture cross sections of Cr,Mn,Ni,Nb,Ag,In,Sb
           and Au in the 8 to 120 keV region
FACILITY   (VDG,3SAFPEL) Pulsed Van de Graaff 3MeV at Pelindaba
           (VDG,3SAFSUN) 5.5MeV at SUNI.
METHOD     (TOF) Time-of-flight used to eliminate background
           gammas and in some cases to measure neutron energy.
INC-SOURCE (P-LI7) Neutron energy was calculated from the proton
           energy, assuming a value of -1.6433 MeV for the
           Li-7(p,n)Be-7 reaction Q-value, or determined from
           the time-of-flight measurement.
SAMPLE     Metal disks of either 2.5 cm or 5.1 cm diam.
DETECTOR   (MOXR) Moxon RAE detectors with plastic scintillator
CORRECTION Corrections have been made for multiple scattering and
           self-screening.
COMMENT    The two data sets in subents 019 and 020 for the
           In-0(n,g) reaction correspond to different geometries.
ERR-ANALYS (DATA-ERR) No details given
STATUS     (TABLE) Data correspond to Fig 5 -7 of Nucl. Phys.,
           vol. A121, p. 655(1968).
HISTORY    (19970604A)Keywords added in subent 001,subents 019 and
           020 added ( previous subents 78013007, -008).
           (20080208A) BIB section updated
ENDBIB              28
NOCOMMON             0          0
ENDSUBENT           31
ENDENTRY             1
